              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yemwe bagore, ni mwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho, amatwi yanyu yumvirize ijambo ryo mu kanwa kiwe; mwigishe abakobga banyu kuboroga, umugore wese yigishe mugenzi we gucura akanihiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.20",
