              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ urupfu rwūriye rugaca mu madirisha yacu, rukinjira n’i bukuru bgacu; rukaririka abana bari hanze, n’abasore bari mu mayira. ",
          "type": "text",
